  "translation": "Today this supermarket is very big. My mother and I went to the supermarket together. There are many people in the supermarket. We first bought fruit, and also bought vegetables. Mom asked me what I wanted to eat, and I said I wanted to eat tomatoes. We walked from the fruit section to the vegetable section and met a neighbor. The neighbor was buying milk. We chatted for a while. Finally, we bought an ice cream and then went home. Today is really happy!"
